note: a list kept with "keep" is fixed: it can't change, and it's written out from fixed values
keep weekdays as a list of "Mon", "Tue" and "Wed"
keep primes as a list of 2, 3 and 5
keep has_two as primes contains 2
keep grid as a list of (a list of 1) and (a list of 2)
keep no_rows as an empty list of lists of numbers
keep mixed as a list of 1, "two" and 3
keep reversed_primes as primes reversed
keep doubled as primes plus primes
add "Thu" to the end of weekdays
remove item 1 from weekdays
set item 1 of weekdays to "Sun"
insert 1 at position 1 of primes
sort weekdays
add "Thu" to weekdays
set primes to a list of 1
